+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <title>Privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
+    <a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a>
+    <a href="/">Back to home</a>
+  </nav>
+  <main class="container policy">
+    <h1>Privacy, by default</h1>
+    <p>Last updated: November 6, 2026.</p>
+    <p>You can browse this website without giving us personal information. We use no analytics, advertising trackers, fingerprinting, tracking cookies, or browser storage. There are no client-side scripts.</p>
+    <h2>What is needed to deliver a page</h2>
+    <p>Your browser sends technical information, including your IP address and request headers, to the server delivering this website. Our application uses requests only to serve pages and does not keep request logs, create visitor profiles, or store submitted personal information. Do not put personal information or secrets into page URLs.</p>
+    <p>The hosting provider or network infrastructure may process connection information and maintain security logs under their own settings. Those settings and retention periods must be reviewed by the site operator; this application cannot control infrastructure logs.</p>
+    <h2>Resources stay on this site</h2>
+    <p>Our photo and stylesheet are hosted on this site. Viewing a page does not contact an image provider, analytics service, social network, or external font service. We do not sell or share visitor profiles.</p>
+    <h2>Your browser data</h2>
+    <p>This website creates no account records or saved preferences. The button below asks compatible browsers to clear this origin’s cookies, storage, and cache over HTTPS. It affects other applications on the same origin too. It does not delete records held by a hosting provider, and browser support varies.</p>
+    <form action="/logout" method="post">
+      <button class="btn" type="submit">Clear site data</button>
+    </form>
+    <h2>Accounts and orders</h2>
+    <p>Account, rewards, and ordering links on the homepage are placeholders. This version does not register accounts, accept orders, or collect payment details. Any future service must explain its purpose, required information, retention period, and access or deletion options before collecting data.</p>
+  </main>
+  <footer><a href="/">The Daily Grind home</a></footer>
+</body>
+</html>
